ry example. Use conflicting overlaps to infer priority, include number clauses and the default, then apply the first matching clause to the new signal.", "amount": null, "status": null, "why": null}], [1351, {"event": "room_msg", "session_id": "talk-s4101-fb3e4c", "round": 7, "phase": "prep", "tick": 1, "room": "R1", "src": "agent-6", "kind": "say", "text": "Check all 15 examples for an exact ordered rule, then apply the first matching clause to the new signal. Test overlaps carefully; the first matching condition determines the action.", "amount": null, "status": null, "why": null}]]}, {"path": "/Users/bagjuhyeon/squid5-runs/e52_v32/squid5_e52v32_public_opus4/20261019_1445_claude-opus-5-5/events.jsonl", "bytes": 6014911, "sha256": "cb61ae3d726e84d58694a80889b56e6b6f81144d7f10c9df4d80edeebc2b8dc8", "bad": [], "lines": 1376, "calls": 456, "thinking_calls": 0, "reply_calls": 456, "seeds": {"talk-s4101-4f99fb": 4101, "talk-s4102-9e7fe9": 4102, "talk-s4103-9168e7": 4103}, "rounds": {"4101": 8, "4102": 8, "4103": 8}, "room_msgs": 282, "hits": [], "roomhits": []}, {"path": "/Users/bagjuhyeon/squid5-runs/e52_v32/squid5_e52v32_public_sol4/20261019_1445_gpt-6-sol/events.jsonl", "bytes": 2924631, "sha256": "50d1988545f623967b37c917b35117d658428624cfbe462201a6789c1e5093d2", "bad": [], "lines": 1058, "calls": 366, "thinking_calls": 298, "reply_calls": 365, "seeds": {"talk-s4101-e3a947": 4101, "talk-s4102-913d8e": 4102, "talk-s4103-a727b5": 4103}, "rounds": {"4101": 8, "4102": 8, "4103": 8}, "room_msgs": 163, "hits": [{"line": 25, "seed": 4103, "round": 1, "agent": "agent-23", "phase": "prep", "tick": 1, "field": "text", "terms": ["test"], "excerpts": ["TO R1: I’m staying. Agent-6, please use the examples to test candidate rules against all 20 labels before choosing.\nDONE"], "full": "TO R1: I’m staying. Agent-6, please use the examples to test candidate rules against all 20 labels before choosing.\nDONE"}, {"line": 41, "seed": 4101, "round": 1, "agent": "agent-17", "phase": "pr