+**Kimi — 시뮬레이션 속 역할로 자신을 구분.** [KIMI:117], seed **4101**, round **1**, **agent-17**, TALK BEFORE SOLVE **tick 2**, `thinking`:
+
+> We are ChatGPT in this simulation; final should contain the reply to the session.
+
